// The light client's weak-subjectivity pin: macroblock K (index and MacroBlock::hash) with the committee-derivation
// anchors of K and K-1, so a walk starts at K instead of at genesis. It is the wallets' release pin, the block between
// the markers kept identical to applications/qnet-mobile/src/config/genesisConsensus.js (made by that app's
// scripts/ws-pin.js, each pin proven from the one before it); the site's tests compare the two. The site proves no
// state at or below K: the pin carries K's committee data, not its state root.
